{"5271470":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Crown of Time","steam_appid":5271470,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"Every clock struck thirteen. A forest grows and decays in the same afternoon. An army repeats its final battle. Beside your own grave waits an impossible letter: “This time, save the village first.”<br><br><strong>Crown of Time is a single-player idle RPG about rebuilding a refuge in a kingdom living on borrowed time.<\/strong> Work by hand when you want to play, and give your Echoes useful work to continue while you are away.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/0e5878a66e79bdb18a80c17b9ba8d834.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Build a refuge worth returning to\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Restore the last working clocktower, rekindle the forge, reopen the archive, and give people displaced from their own centuries somewhere to belong. Six restoration tracks turn a damaged settlement into a home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/6603d88d78cbe3921e6b1c8ac855ea75.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Make every life count\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Mine ore, cut timber, fish, and gather herbs. Turn those materials into equipment, meals, and alchemical supplies. Choose how many to gather or make at once, set the work going and press again to hurry it along, then give work of their own to up to two Echoes—other lives you might have lived. Your lives share resources and experience, so gathering and crafting form one connected economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/8525cee72e959e11328e3d9c456e104d.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Explore a kingdom across three ages\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Travel through five regions, from the Stillwood to the Fractured Capital, each with its own Past, Present, and Future, and at the last to a sixth place that stands outside time. Walk the journeys marked on each scene: a road to each guardian, forages and hunts, every one a fixed road of crossings that ends in a fight, with skirmishes on the way to the guardians. Weigh a safe cache against a costly climb, reach into time rifts, share your food with a stranger or pay a toll of light, sit a while with the Past Echo or the Future Echo, and decide when to turn back. Offline time continues assigned work; a journey’s crossings wait for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/eb4a9115ca9116ae8de1d9f02f46bc99.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Prepare, then face the guardians\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Fill seven equipment slots and choose three of your seven abilities, then fight by hand: drink your potions between fights, time your abilities, eat when it counts, and know when to retreat. Overcome twenty-one guardians, among them the three who hold the crown’s fragments. Your preparation shapes the fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/b74f48b22406f6668be4218da6fc7ebd.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Recover the Crown of Time\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Uncover the stories the crown’s bargains left behind. Open the Past first and the Future later, each waking another life of yours to work beside you. Win back the crown one fragment at a time, join the three at the Clocktower, and carry the Crown of Time to the one ending that closes the story.","about_the_game":"Every clock struck thirteen. A forest grows and decays in the same afternoon. An army repeats its final battle. Beside your own grave waits an impossible letter: “This time, save the village first.”<br><br><strong>Crown of Time is a single-player idle RPG about rebuilding a refuge in a kingdom living on borrowed time.<\/strong> Work by hand when you want to play, and give your Echoes useful work to continue while you are away.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/0e5878a66e79bdb18a80c17b9ba8d834.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Build a refuge worth returning to\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Restore the last working clocktower, rekindle the forge, reopen the archive, and give people displaced from their own centuries somewhere to belong. Six restoration tracks turn a damaged settlement into a home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/6603d88d78cbe3921e6b1c8ac855ea75.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Make every life count\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Mine ore, cut timber, fish, and gather herbs. Turn those materials into equipment, meals, and alchemical supplies. Choose how many to gather or make at once, set the work going and press again to hurry it along, then give work of their own to up to two Echoes—other lives you might have lived. Your lives share resources and experience, so gathering and crafting form one connected economy.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/8525cee72e959e11328e3d9c456e104d.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Explore a kingdom across three ages\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Travel through five regions, from the Stillwood to the Fractured Capital, each with its own Past, Present, and Future, and at the last to a sixth place that stands outside time. Walk the journeys marked on each scene: a road to each guardian, forages and hunts, every one a fixed road of crossings that ends in a fight, with skirmishes on the way to the guardians. Weigh a safe cache against a costly climb, reach into time rifts, share your food with a stranger or pay a toll of light, sit a while with the Past Echo or the Future Echo, and decide when to turn back. Offline time continues assigned work; a journey’s crossings wait for you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/eb4a9115ca9116ae8de1d9f02f46bc99.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Prepare, then face the guardians\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Fill seven equipment slots and choose three of your seven abilities, then fight by hand: drink your potions between fights, time your abilities, eat when it counts, and know when to retreat. Overcome twenty-one guardians, among them the three who hold the crown’s fragments. Your preparation shapes the fight.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/extras\/b74f48b22406f6668be4218da6fc7ebd.avif?t=1793689655\" alt=\"Recover the Crown of Time\" width=1170 height=280 \/><\/span><br><br>Uncover the stories the crown’s bargains left behind. Open the Past first and the Future later, each waking another life of yours to work beside you. Win back the crown one fragment at a time, join the three at the Clocktower, and carry the Crown of Time to the one ending that closes the story.","short_description":"Rebuild a forgotten kingdom in this dark-fantasy idle RPG. Gather and craft by hand, command Echoes to work while you’re away, and explore Past, Present, and Future. Fight the guardians by hand, gather the crown’s three fragments, and reach the one place that stands outside time.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/807bf65a91b2de2ded362814244a3457d5619dbc\/header.jpg?t=1793689655","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/a8cbc1c1a2e358e817d1b34581e099aeec0477ee\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793689655","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5271470\/a8cbc1c1a2e358e817d1b34581e099aeec0477ee\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793689655","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit with supported updates<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 530 or comparable integrated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-8400 or AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> DirectX 11-capable integrated or dedicated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 2 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"de